(text "TS06-DRV  ·  Digit decoders"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 12.7 0)
(effects
(font
(size 3 3)
(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "d9de1aaa-9248-569f-97c2-690ca3f5a944")
)
(text "Two К155ИД1 (SN74141 pinout) share the Nano's A0-A3. U2 drives the ИН-12 cathode bus through XS11, U17 the ИН-17 pair through XS12 pins 1-10, both\nwith the board's own digit map (BOARD_TYPE 4)."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 19.05 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "c7f718d4-b900-5b62-a21a-76afece58d56")
)
(text "Inputs: A0 -> C, A1 -> B, A2 -> D, A3 -> A on both chips, the wiring the firmware's decoderNibble()\nassumes. Firmware digit map BOARD_TYPE 4: digitMask[] = {1, 0, 5, 4, 6, 7, 3, 2, 9, 8} (digit d -> code)."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 152.4 86.36 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "d57e7f59-f77b-5f7a-8b1d-4fc75cbd519d")
)
(text "Notes from tools/ts06pair.py"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 152.4 135.89 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "854537e8-d67b-5fbf-9c56-774f94ed7615")
)
(text "U2: ИН-12 bus decoder -> XS11. Digit map BOARD_TYPE 4 (see DIGIT_MASK4).\nU17: ИН-17 pair decoder -> XS12 pins 1-10, same inputs and digit map as U2."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 152.4 138.43 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "ab94df79-47cc-594c-9ce4-1d67abc172ae")
)
